 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t a single objectively “best” AI marketing agency in Los Angeles—it depends on whether you need AI-search visibility, paid campaigns, lead generation, or marketing automation.\n\n**For AI-search visibility (appearing in ChatGPT, Gemini, and similar tools), LAv1 looks like a strong option for small and mid-sized businesses.** It focuses on AI-driven SEO and local search, and reports case studies involving clients appearing in AI recommendations. **For broader digital marketing with AI-visibility services, Thrive is another option**, with SEO, PPC, and reported growth in AI-platform traffic.\n\nTreat agency case studies as self-reported, and ask for results from clients similar to your business. Before choosing, compare the proposed strategy, measurement plan, fees, and who will actually do the work.",
